ent-Shisha = shisha
    .desc = A portable water pipe. Add coal and ground tobacco or other smokable filler, then light it. Click to take or return the hose. Drag the base onto yourself to carry it. The hose retracts when stretched too far.
ent-ShishaHose = shisha hose
    .desc = A mouthpiece connected to a shisha. Activate it in your hand or use it on yourself to take a puff. Use it on its base to put it back.
